OL,3,AJimmy McGovern claims young offenders
OL,4,Ainstitute staff 'lazy'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA BAFTA-winning screenwriter whose new
OL,7,Fdrama is set in a young offenders
OL,8,Finstitute has said he believed keeping
OL,9,Finmates isolated from each other for
OL,10,Flong periods allowed staff to "sit on
OL,11,Ftheir backsides all day and do
OL,12,Fnothing".
OL,14,FJimmy McGovern, writer of BBC drama
OL,15,FTime, said he was shocked after
OL,16,Fvisiting "appalling" facilities while
OL,17,Fresearching the latest series.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,167,160,200,105,0,100
